      "Relationship to Milestones": "Workshops and Milestones are related in the following ways:\n1. Workshops help teams plan for and review their milestones.\n2. Milestones are often planned and reviewed in team workshops.",
      "Relationship to Tools": "Workshops and Tools are related in the following ways:\n1. Workshops make use of shared tools like boards and templates.\n2. Tools like shared boards and templates are what make workshops run.",
