      "Relationship to Job Functions": "Workshops and Job Functions are related in the following ways:\n1. Workshops bring different job functions together to collaborate.\n2. Different job functions lead or take part in different workshops.",
      "Relationship to Job Specializations": "Workshops and Job Specializations are related in the following ways:\n1. Workshops bring different specializations together to solve a shared problem.\n2. A specialization often leads the workshops that sit closest to its focus.",
      "Relationship to Company Types": "Workshops and Company Types are related in the following ways:\n1. The company type shapes which workshops a team runs.\n2. The company type shapes which workshops a team runs and how.",
      "Relationship to Methodologies": "Workshops and Methodologies are related in the following ways:\n1. Workshops put a methodology into practice through guided sessions.\n2. A methodology often comes with workshops that put it into practice.",
      "Relationship to Workshops": "Workshops and other Workshops are related in the following ways:\n1. Workshops build on one another, with earlier ones feeding later ones.\n2. The output of one workshop often becomes the input for the next.",
      "Relationship to Job Industries": "Workshops and Job Industries are related in the following ways:\n1. People bring their industry background into the workshops they join.\n2. The industry someone comes from shapes what they bring to a workshop.",
